hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1688","\nNarrated to us Muhammad ibn Bashshar, who said: Narrated to me 'Amr ibn 'Asim, who said: Narrated to me Hammam, from Qatadah, from Muwarriq al-'Ijli, from Abu al-Ahwas, from 'Abdullah, from the Prophet (ﷺ), who said:\n\n\The prayer of a woman in her house is more excellent than her prayer in her private chamber.\""\n\n---"""""
